      "subtitle": "英语二小作文 · 2013 真题",
      "questionText": "47. Directions:\nSuppose your class is to hold a charity sale for kids in need of help. Write your classmates an email to\n1) inform them about the details, and\n2) encourage them to participate.\nYou should write about 100 words on the ANSWER SHEET.\nDo not use your own name. Use “Li Ming” instead.\nDo not write your address. (10 points)",
      "questionImages": [],
      "referenceText": "Dear classmates,\n\nIt is a great honor to inform you that a charity sale is scheduled for September 23, from 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. It will be held in the auditorium for the sake of children at risk of dropping out, and all proceeds will be donated to Project Hope. We aim to raise enough money to help fifteen children from financially strained families. Your participation is essential to achieving this goal.\n\nI hope you will come and find something you like. You will be glad to find the latest books and pretty stationery on sale at a discount.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Ming"
