      "referenceText": "Volunteers Wanted!\n\nStarting from July 15, a three-week summer camp will be hosted for high school students on our campus. It features various academic and entrepreneurial activities, such as a series of lectures by prominent professors and a business plan competition, which are designed to inspire students to attain greater achievements.\n\nWe are recruiting volunteers to help organize these activities and cope with daily affairs during the camp. Ideal candidates should be patient, active, warm-hearted and responsible; relevant experience is preferred. Anyone interested, please contact the Students' Union at 12345678.\n\nThe Students' Union"
