      "subtitle": "英语二小作文 · 2016 真题",
      "questionText": "47. Directions:\nSuppose you won a translation contest and your friend, Jack, wrote an email to congratulate you and ask for advice on translation. Write him a reply to\n1) thank him, and\n2) give your advice.\nYou should write about 100 words on the ANSWER SHEET.\nDo not use your own name. Use “Li Ming” instead.\nDo not write your address. (10 points)",
      "questionImages": [],
      "referenceText": "Dear Jack,\n\nI'm writing to express my gratitude for your congratulations on my success in the translation contest. Since you asked for my advice, I'd like to share some thoughts on improving translation skills.\n\nTo begin with, appreciate the beauty of language and hone your reading skills. Read extensively and keep abreast of current events and issues. Moreover, be persistent. Language learning cannot be accomplished within a short time; only sustained efforts can improve our translation skills.\n\nI hope these suggestions help. I look forward to your reply.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Ming"
