      "referenceText": "Dear Professor Smith,\n\nI am writing to apologize for not being able to visit you as planned. I have been asked to substitute for a classmate who suddenly fell ill and attend an important meeting, so I must cancel my travel plan. I am terribly sorry for any inconvenience this causes you and any changes it necessitates in your current plans.\n\nI have been looking forward to seeing you since we made the appointment. If it is possible, I would like to reschedule our meeting to a time convenient for you. Thank you for your understanding. I look forward to your reply.\n\nSincerely yours,\nLi Ming"
