      "title": "介绍兵马俑并给出参观建议",
      "subtitle": "英语二小作文 · 2020 真题",
      "questionText": "47. Directions:\nSuppose you are planning a tour of a historical site for a group of international students. Write an email to\n1)tell them about the site, and\n2)give them some tips for the tour.\nYou should write about 100 words on the ANSWER SHEET.\nDo not use your own name, use “Li Ming” instead. (10 points)",
      "questionImages": [],
      "referenceText": "Dear Friends,\n\nI'm delighted that you trust me to arrange your trip. I'm writing to tell you about the Terracotta Army, one of the greatest archaeological discoveries of all time, and to share some travel tips.\n\nLocated east of downtown Xi'an, it is a massive collection of life-size clay warriors and horses buried in the tomb of China's First Emperor. It offers a fascinating glimpse into the country's glorious past. To enjoy these breathtaking sculptures, you may consider avoiding public holidays or setting out early. It is also advisable to rent a multilingual audio guide at the ticket office, which will make your trip more informative.\n\nHope you all enjoy the trip.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Ming"
