      "subtitle": "英语二小作文 · 2021 真题",
      "questionText": "47. Directions:\nSuppose you are organizing an online meeting. Write an email to Jack, an international student, to\n1) invite him to participate, and\n2) tell him the details.\nYou should write about 100 words on the ANSWER SHEET.\nDo not use your own name. Use “Li Ming” instead.(10 points)",
      "questionImages": [],
      "referenceText": "Dear Jack,\n\nAs an organizer of our monthly reading session, I am writing to invite you to our online meeting scheduled for next Friday from 2 p.m. to 4 p.m. via Zoom.\n\nWith the theme of A Famous Writer from Your Country, this meeting aims to expose participants to writers and works from diverse cultures. Attendees will gather to engage in cross-cultural exchanges and enhance their understanding of literature. As a literary enthusiast, you are welcome to share your insights into the differences between English and Chinese literature.\n\nThe meeting arrangements are attached. We would be very pleased if you could accept our invitation.\n\nYours sincerely,\nLi Ming"
